  "description": "RACE THE UNKNOWN. The Gravelator Exonic, Supreme and Prestige models were developed with one goal: maximum performance on every kilometer. They represent modern gravel racing in its purest form – lightweight, efficient, and uncompromisingly fast. At the heart of the series is the advanced carbon frame, featuring FIS – Full Integrated Storage: hidden inside the downtube, yet exceptionally practical in use. Tools, nutrition, or spare parts – everything is securely stored and always within easy reach. The package is further enhanced by the HUT – Helpful Universal Tool: a tool that is always there when you need it. The two flagship models, Exonic and Supreme, also feature a Premium Carbon frame, further reducing overall weight and elevating performance to the next level. To ensure riders can unlock their full potential at any time, all three models come equipped with a power meter as standard. Precise performance data is always available, whether during training, racing, or chasing the next personal best. From the first pedal stroke to the final sprint, every detail of these bikes has been engineered for racing. No compromises. No distractions. Just the finish line ahead.",
